      "content": "AI & Machine Learning | Google Cloud Blog AI & Machine Learning Find news, updates, and best practices for AI and machine learning solutions on Google Cloud. AI & Machine Learning Introducing Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, powering the next wave of agents Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform is our new platform to build, scale, govern, and optimize agents. It integrates the model selection, model building, and agent building capabilities of Vertex AI, with new features for agent integration, DevOps, and orchestration, and security. By Michael Gerstenhaber • 12-minute read Read article AI & Machine Learning The new Gemini Enterprise: one platform for agent development, orchestration, and governance By Brian Delahunty • 7-minute read AI & Machine Learning What Google Cloud announced in AI this month By Andrea Sanin • 17-minute read News in short A quick take on updates, announcements, resources, events, and learning opportunities from Google Cloud in one handy location. Updated weekly. Read now AI & Machine Learning Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite is now generally available on Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform By Michael Gerstenhaber • 4-minute read AI & Machine Learning How BASF manages thousands of supply chain decisions with AlphaEvolve’s agentic algorithms By Benjamin Priese • 4-minute read Retail Fitting the future: How Breuninger boosted sales with its \"be your own model\" AI By Dr. Michael Menzel • 4-minute read Developers & Practitioners Pioneering AI-assisted code migration: How Google achieved 6x faster migration from TensorFlow to JAX By Jamie Rogers • 5-minute read Startups The Blueprint: Translating stream-of-conscious speech into responsive, actionable task lists By Gonçalo Silva • 5-minute read Developers & Practitioners Five must-have guides to move agents into production with Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform By Addy Osmani • 5-minute read Security & Identity Introducing Agent Gateway ISV ecosystem for security and governance By Ashish Verma • 6-minute read Security & Identity Cloud CISO Perspectives: At Next ‘26, why we’re multicloud and multi-AI By Francis deSouza • 6-minute read Startups The founder’s AI foundation: The top announcements for startups from Next ‘26 By Darren Mowry • 8-minute read Databases UKG unlocks real-time workforce intelligence at scale with the Agentic Data Cloud By Radhi Chagarlamudi • 4-minute read Load more stories"
